        {
          "title": "智圆行方",
          "summary": "心不细，则为粗鲁之徒，亦败事之端也。囿者，周密也，智不圆，则纵漏丛出。所谓\"行成于思，毁于随\"。为人行事，行不方，则无以立身显名，甚则阡诈油滑，邪恶心人也。",
          "url": "https://www.xuexi.cn/dc12897105c8c496d783c5e4d3b680a2/9a75e290b9cf8cb8fb529a6e503db78d.html?query=%E6%99%BA%E5%9C%86%E8%A1%8C%E6%96%B9&page=1&search_source=1&program_id=1&product_params=%7B%22time_filter%22%3A%22all%22%2C%22type_filter%22%3A%22all%22%2C%22sort_method%22%3A%22integrated%22%2C%22wenhui_sort_method%22%3A%22near_far%22%2C%22search_method%22%3A%22all%22%7D",
